<H3 align=center>Raid Collection</H3><BR>
<H4 align=center>Photos by Easirok</H4><BR>
<P align=center <A href="app_gallery.asp" title="View Gallery Listing...">Gallery Listing</A></P><p align=center>Taking down Xenovorash for Brothar<br><IMG border=2 width=640 height=480 src="images/gallery/14/EQ000003.jpg"></p><p align=center>Brothar completes his EPIC!<br><IMG border=2 width=640 height=480 src="images/gallery/14/EQ000004.jpg"></p><p align=center>The only way to do the Chardok Royals... AE style!<br><IMG border=2 width=640 height=480 src="images/gallery/14/EQ000008.jpg"></p><p align=center>Now what ya gonna do Mr Prince? All your guards are DEAD!<br><IMG border=2 width=640 height=480 src="images/gallery/14/EQ000009.jpg"></p><p align=center>Severilous isn't all too happy with this crew<br><IMG border=2 width=640 height=480 src="images/gallery/14/EQ000011.jpg"></p><p align=center>I managed to get a couple hits in between the numerous unresisted dragon roars...<br><IMG border=2 width=640 height=480 src="images/gallery/14/EQ000012.jpg"></p><p align=center>And my group gets the kill! No idea how we pulled that off... but I wasn't complaining!<br><IMG border=2 width=640 height=480 src="images/gallery/14/EQ000013.jpg"></p><p align=center>First big encounter on Stormhammer... After a few failed tries, we picked<BR>ourselves up and managed to kill the dracoliche in Fear.<br><IMG border=2 width=640 height=480 src="images/gallery/14/EQ000024.jpg"></p><p align=center>My first "event" on Stormhammer... an open Gorenaire raid<BR>called on by a GM known as "The Dragon Slayer".<br><IMG border=2 width=640 height=480 src="images/gallery/14/EQ000025.jpg"></p><p align=center>Gorenaire goes down... along with a few of the under-50 folks that helped out.<br><IMG border=2 width=640 height=480 src="images/gallery/14/EQ000027.jpg"></p><p align=center>And here we see the mad rush as 20 loot-hungry people<BR>click like crazy on the corpse, trying to take the loot.<br><IMG border=2 width=640 height=480 src="images/gallery/14/EQ000028.jpg"></p><p align=center>Staring Trakanon in the face on another GM Event. This time we were helping a<BR>frog named Tamchi retrieve his lost paints from Pumj,<BR>but we had to go through Trakanon to get it.<br><IMG border=2 width=640 height=480 src="images/gallery/14/EQ000030.jpg"></p><p align=center>Lord Yelinak<br><IMG border=2 width=820 height=588 src="members.aol.com/daclifster/images/yeli.jpg"></p>
